  "customHelp": "RPC - Rock Paper Scissors Deckbuilder (playtest)\n\nGOAL: most VP when the bank empties.\n\nTURN: Clear (trim Rule Row to 5) - Draw (up to 7) - 3 Actions (play a rule to Rule Row, play an instant, or draw) - Buy (declare a money pool from hand, buy from Buy up to that value) - Battle (challenge up to 2 players OR fight 1 boss) - End (refill Buy).\n\nBATTLE: challenge a player. Each activates rule cards (1 free; a 2nd costs 1 VP, refunded on a win). Non-battlers bet. Both secretly throw one card from hand into Battle Arena, then reveal. Rock>Scissors>Paper>Rock. Winner gains 1 VP + 1 per rule card played (both sides, cancelled rules included).\n\nBETS (non-battlers, max 3 VP): Winner 2x - Throw 3x - Parlay 4x.\n\nBOSS: pay entry VP, throw vs the Boss Play deck. Win = take the boss into your deck; lose = pay its VP.\n\nVP: start 3 each; bank = 20 x players. At 0 VP you hold 1 temporary VP.\nNote: card draw is 'up to 7' - top your hand up manually each turn.",
